        <mxCell id="c194" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#64748B;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" value="Ghi chu pham vi &amp; quy uoc:&#xa;- Chi hien 3-5 thuoc tinh dai dien/entity (uu tien PK + cac truong dinh danh quan he) de giu ERD tong the de doc -&#xa;  danh sach day du thuoc tinh xem o Class Diagram tuong ung (CD 22-26).&#xa;- TAT CA quan he trong he thong la tham chieu logic cap ung dung (Schema.Types.Mixed), KHONG phai Mongoose ref()/populate() -&#xa;  xac nhan qua grep toan bo *.model.ts: khong co &#39;ref:&#39; o dau ca. Cardinality the hien dung nghiep vu du vay.&#xa;- TOPIC va GRAMMAR_TOPIC la bang tra cuu doc lap (QuizService validate/doi chieu bang gia tri chuoi &#39;topic&#39;/&#39;grammar&#39; luc&#xa;  sinh Quiz, KHONG luu lai id tham chieu) - vi vay KHONG ve duong quan he den chung (&quot;island entity&quot;, dung nhu schema thuc te).&#xa;- CEFR Level (A1-C2) la mang HARD-CODE trong TopicService.getLevels(), KHONG phai 1 collection trong MongoDB -&#xa;  vi vay KHONG xuat hien nhu 1 Entity trong ERD nay.&#xa;- PRODUCES (tuy chon): 1 WritingAttempt CO THE gan voi 1 WritingSession (sessionId?) hoac duoc nop doc lap (luyen tap tu do)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="194" width="3300" x="150" y="3020" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
