        <mxCell id="c17" value="Ghi chu:&#xa;- 19 chu diem luon MO, KHONG khoa theo thu tu (phong cach W3Schools) - khac voi cau hinh &#39;hoc tuan tu&#39; thong thuong.&#xa;- He thong TU DONG danh dau da xem (section-viewed) khi Member mo tab Learn/Examples - khong phai 1 thao tac&#xa;  nguoi dung chu dong bam, nen khong ve nhu 1 use case rieng.&#xa;- XP/Level (gamification) tinh DONG moi lan goi API tien do (khong luu field co dinh), CONG THUC:&#xa;  xp = totalWriting*8 + (totalWriting*averageScore)/20 + completedTopics*100 + paragraphGoodAttempts*40.&#xa;- Tab &#39;AI Writing&#39; va &#39;Practice&#39; goi CHUNG API voi trang Luyen viet cau (Sentence AI Writing) - xem UC rieng&#xa;  o trang &#39;Use Case Diagram - Sentence AI Writing&#39; de biet chi tiet luong AI sinh de + cham bai." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#64748B;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
