        <mxCell id="c19" value="Ghi chu:&#xa;- He thong tu dong loc cau hoi trung lap gan giong nhau (Jaccard similarity) va can bang so cau theo tung thi,&#xa;  thu lai toi da 3 vong (MAX_GENERATION_ROUNDS) truoc khi bao loi; tu dong dung Heuristic Provider khi Gemini loi.&#xa;- Dap an dung (correctAnswer, explanation) KHONG duoc gui ve Frontend truoc khi Nop bai.&#xa;- Nop bai cham diem hoan toan noi bo (so khop voi correctAnswer da luu trong DB) - KHONG goi lai AI luc nay." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#64748B;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
