        <mxCell id="c21" value="Ghi chu:&#xa;- Co 2 cach vao bai viet: (1) AI sinh de MOI theo chu de/thi tu chon, (2) chon 1 cau CO SAN tu Question Bank&#xa;  roi lam bai truc tiep - ca 2 deu goi CHUNG 1 API nop bai (POST /writing/attempts).&#xa;- Dap an chuan (referenceAnswer) KHONG bao gio duoc gui ve Frontend truoc khi nop bai (ca 2 nhanh Mongo/in-memory&#xa;  deu loai bo field nay).&#xa;- Goi y (Hint System) chi goi ve tu vung/cau truc chung, KHONG bao gio chua nguyen van 1 cau tieng Anh hoan chinh.&#xa;- Moi lan nop (ke ca Rewrite) tao 1 document WritingAttempt MOI (KHAC co che revisions[] cua Paragraph Writing)&#xa;  - day la co so de &#39;So sanh cac lan nop&#39; hoat dong duoc." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#64748B;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="280" y="800.0" width="1000" height="158" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
