        <mxCell id="c13" value="Ghi chu:&#xa;- Neu Member chua tung yeu cau chan doan AI, he thong TU DONG sinh 1 ban khi vao trang (lazy - getLatestAIAnalysis).&#xa;- &#39;Yeu cau AI chan doan diem yeu&#39; la hanh dong CHU DONG (&lt;&lt;extend&gt;&gt;) de tao ban chan doan MOI, thay cho ban cu.&#xa;- Analytics KHONG bao gom he thong XP/Level (gamification) - XP/Level thuoc tab Progress cua Grammar Learning,&#xa;  xem UC rieng o trang &#39;Use Case Diagram - Grammar Learning&#39; de tranh nham lan 2 khai niem nay." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#64748B;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
